There was a twist in the courtroom, too.

274
00:11:10,947 --> 00:11:13,743
The defense pointed to an email from a DEA agent.

275
00:11:14,243 --> 00:11:16,479
In it, according to the Mercury News, the

276
00:11:16,479 --> 00:11:18,988
