287
00:11:42,635 --> 00:11:46,133
On April 30, 2024, the jury came back.

288
00:11:47,133 --> 00:11:48,049
Ronald Yandell.

289
00:11:48,049 --> 00:11:50,673
Guilty of murder in aid of racketeering for

290
00:11:50,673 --> 00:11:51,711
