295
00:12:01,544 --> 00:12:02,577
Billy Sylvester.

296
00:12:02,577 --> 00:12:05,354
Guilty of murder in aid of racketeering for

297
00:12:05,354 --> 00:12:08,712
the 2011 killing, RICO conspiracy, and drug charges.

298
00:12:09,312 --> 00:12:10,252
Danny Troxell.

299
00:12:10,252 --> 00:12:13,205
Guilty of RICO conspiracy, and of conspiring

300
00:12:13,205 --> 00:12:14,347
to commit murder.

301
00:12:15,347 --> 00:12:18,184
Sentencing came in December 2024.

302
00:12:18,684 --> 00:12:21,921
Yandell and Sylvester each got two consecutive

303
00:12:21,921 --> 00:12:22,695
