313
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:46,706
Troxell was sentenced in November 2025, at 72.

314
00:12:46,706 --> 00:12:48,012
Life in prison.

315
00:12:48,612 --> 00:12:51,224
By then, five other members from the case had

316
00:12:51,224 --> 00:12:53,082
already received life sentences.

317
00:12:53,082 --> 00:12:55,695
And there is no parole in the federal system.

318
00:12:56,695 --> 00:12:59,165
The Justice Department called him the final

319
00:12:59,165 --> 00:13:01,175
gang member sentenced in that case.

320
00:13:01,175 --> 00:13:03,646
The two commission members the DEA heard on

321
00:13:03,646 --> 00:13:05,369
those phones are serving life.

322
00:13:05,369 --> 00:13:06,231
With no parole.

323
00:13:07,431 --> 00:13:10,289
If the story ended there, it would be a clean win.

324
00:13:10,889 --> 00:13:12,383
It didn't end there.

325
00:13:13,383 --> 00:13:16,001
While the Sacramento case was moving through

326
00:13:16,001 --> 00:13:18,559
court, a second, multi-agency investigation

327
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,582
was running in the Central Valley.

328
00:13:20,582 --> 00:13:22,963
The federal case that came out of it was

329
00:13:22,963 --> 00:13:24,391
investigated by the ATF.

330
00:13:24,991 --> 00:13:27,880
On November 20, 2020, authorities announced

331
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:28,686
the results.

332
00:13:28,686 --> 00:13:31,374
More than 60 people had been arrested in

333
00:13:31,374 --> 00:13:33,524
California, Nevada, and Montana.

334
00:13:34,324 --> 00:13:36,674
The state attorney general's office, the

335
00:13:36,674 --> 00:13:39,199
Highway Patrol, a regional gang task force,

336
00:13:39,199 --> 00:13:41,784
the ATF, the FBI, and local police in Fresno

337
00:13:41,784 --> 00:13:42,606
all took part.

338
00:13:42,606 --> 00:13:44,897
And the Fresno County District Attorney

339
00:13:44,897 --> 00:13:47,423
charged more than 30 people in state court.

340
00:13:48,123 --> 00:13:50,397
Over the course of the investigation,

341
00:13:50,397 --> 00:13:53,163
authorities seized more than eighty pounds of

342
00:13:53,163 --> 00:13:54,147
methamphetamine.

343
00:13:54,147 --> 00:13:55,315
5 pounds of heroin.

344
00:13:55,315 --> 00:13:56,421
More than 25 guns.

345
00:13:57,421 --> 00:14:00,431
Inside the prisons, the corrections department

346
00:14:00,431 --> 00:14:03,178
searched 63 cells in 14 prisons, and found

347
00:14:03,178 --> 00:14:04,291
phones and drugs.

348
00:14:04,991 --> 00:14:07,756
And investigators said they had intercepted 11

349
00:14:07,756 --> 00:14:10,281
acts of violence before they could happen.

350
00:14:11,281 --> 00:14:14,012
But some of the orders had already gone through.

351
00:14:15,012 --> 00:14:17,740
This case also turned on contraband phones.

352
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:19,833
And on court-authorized wiretaps.

353
00:14:20,333 --> 00:14:23,166
A 70-year-old leader named John Stinson used a

354
00:14:23,166 --> 00:14:25,876
