355
00:14:25,876 --> 00:14:27,539
business, prosecutors said.

356
00:14:27,539 --> 00:14:30,188
He sponsored members, settled disputes, and

357
00:14:30,188 --> 00:14:31,235
approved murders.

358
00:14:31,835 --> 00:14:34,324
And two other leaders, Francis Clement and

359
00:14:34,324 --> 00:14:36,696
Kenneth Johnson, used smuggled phones to

360
00:14:36,696 --> 00:14:39,067
direct crimes inside and outside prison.

361
00:14:39,667 --> 00:14:42,205
Between 2020 and 2022, prosecutors said,

362
00:14:42,205 --> 00:14:44,681
Clement ordered killings in Los Angeles

363
00:14:44,681 --> 00:14:47,029
County, Johnson joining in the first.

364
00:14:47,029 --> 00:14:49,631
Because the victims were believed to have

365
00:14:49,631 --> 00:14:52,424
