366
00:14:53,224 --> 00:14:55,905
Clement was convicted of five counts of murder

367
00:14:55,905 --> 00:14:57,245
in aid of racketeering.

368
00:14:57,245 --> 00:14:58,294
Each one, the U.S.

369
00:14:58,294 --> 00:15:00,974
Attorney's Office said, committed while he was

370
00:15:00,974 --> 00:15:01,907
in state prison.

371
00:15:02,907 --> 00:15:03,790
The acting U.S.

372
00:15:03,790 --> 00:15:06,263
Attorney, Michele Beckwith, said the Aryan

373
00:15:06,263 --> 00:15:08,442
Brotherhood had maintained its deadly

374
00:15:08,442 --> 00:15:11,151
influence over members, associates and others,

375
00:15:11,151 --> 00:15:12,976
both inside and outside prison.

376
00:15:13,676 --> 00:15:16,829
In May 2025, Clement and Johnson got life.

377
00:15:16,829 --> 00:15:19,832
Stinson, already serving life for a 1979

378
00:15:19,832 --> 00:15:23,511
murder, got twenty more years in federal custody.

379
00:15:24,211 --> 00:15:26,659
The acting director of the ATF said the

380
00:15:26,659 --> 00:15:28,605
