383
00:15:34,649 --> 00:15:37,128
The head of the Justice Department's Criminal

384
00:15:37,128 --> 00:15:38,340
Division went further.

385
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:41,268
Organized crime within the prison system,

386
00:15:41,268 --> 00:15:43,980
