411
00:16:43,941 --> 00:16:44,505
The U.S.

412
00:16:44,505 --> 00:16:46,757
Attorney put it in one sentence.

413
00:16:47,157 --> 00:16:49,851
Justin Gray executed two men at point-blank

414
00:16:49,851 --> 00:16:52,420
range because an incarcerated gang member

415
00:16:52,420 --> 00:16:53,109
