419
00:17:03,629 --> 00:17:06,372
Gray was convicted of two counts of murder in

420
00:17:06,372 --> 00:17:07,591
aid of racketeering.

421
00:17:07,591 --> 00:17:10,334
His sentencing is set for Monday, before U.S.

422
00:17:10,334 --> 00:17:12,346
