435
00:17:42,792 --> 00:17:45,727
None of them had yet spent a day in federal prison.

436
00:17:45,727 --> 00:17:48,028
A federal prosecutor told the court, the

437
00:17:48,028 --> 00:17:49,064
wheels are moving.

438
00:17:49,964 --> 00:17:51,841
So what actually changed?

439
00:17:52,441 --> 00:17:55,112
In 2006, the government convicted the Brand's

440
00:17:55,112 --> 00:17:57,427
old leaders and kept them locked in the

441
00:17:57,427 --> 00:17:58,436
