444
00:18:04,299 --> 00:18:06,125
Not with notes, but with phones.

445
00:18:06,725 --> 00:18:09,392
And those same phones put them away.

446
00:18:09,392 --> 00:18:11,836
The DEA's wiretaps in Sacramento.

447
00:18:11,836 --> 00:18:13,317
The ATF's in Fresno.

448
00:18:14,117 --> 00:18:16,931
Ronald Yandell, the man they called Renegade,

449
00:18:16,931 --> 00:18:19,557
is serving two consecutive life sentences.

450
00:18:20,257 --> 00:18:22,860
He told the judge he'd be back on appeal.

451
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:26,302
On Monday, another man who followed an order

452
00:18:26,302 --> 00:18:28,729
