453
00:18:28,729 --> 00:18:29,307
word life.

454
00:18:30,307 --> 00:18:31,248
What do you think?

455
00:18:31,248 --> 00:18:33,603
Can any prison really cut a gang off from the

456
00:18:33,603 --> 00:18:34,022
